    open val openLinksWarnBody: String = "For: a pasted address works like it does everywhere else, with no syntax to learn. The full address stays visible as text, so you can see where a link goes before you tap it.\n\nAgainst: tapping hands the address to another app. Your browser sees it, the destination sees your IP address, and none of that is covered by Lucent's own encryption. A link in a note someone shared with you is then one tap from opening.\n\nOnly http and https addresses are ever opened. Blackout Mode overrides this switch — while it is on, nothing is handed to a browser."
